{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "正式签约星天  (Xin Huimei Signs With Xingtian)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Xingtian's packed press conference, Xin Huimei announces her signing, PR chief Stella reports that police caught the photo fabricator, and Bu Xiaogu suddenly understands Professor Fang's lesson on turning enemies into allies. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得星天跟我的三观更合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "并且星天有我非常信任的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "早上我已经转发了，这件事情警方已经介入了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "大家在网上看到的那些不雅的照片，其实是合成的，嫌疑人也已经抓到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这种对于成功的女性恶意的攻击和构陷，是非常无耻的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "在这里我顺便也向大家澄清一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "最近这两天一直有人在电视上吵架，并且频频提到了我的名字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我向来都是用作品说话的，都用不着别人来评论我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "至于你想拿我的名字去刷话题，我的律师团队是非常专业的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "道可道，反过来读，你也能读得通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背，亲可成仇，敌可化友！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得星天跟我的三观更合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I feel Xingtian aligns much better with my values.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "并且星天有我非常信任的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And Xingtian has someone whom I trust deeply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "早上我已经转发了，这件事情警方已经介入了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I shared the statement this morning, and the police have already stepped in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "大家在网上看到的那些不雅的照片，其实是合成的，嫌疑人也已经抓到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those indecent photos everyone saw online were digitally fabricated, and the suspect has been caught.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这种对于成功的女性恶意的攻击和构陷，是非常无耻的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Such malicious attacks and framing aimed at a successful woman are utterly shameless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "在这里我顺便也向大家澄清一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'While I am here, let me also clear one more thing up for everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "最近这两天一直有人在电视上吵架，并且频频提到了我的名字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over the past couple of days people kept arguing on television and repeatedly brought up my name.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我向来都是用作品说话的，都用不着别人来评论我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have always let my work speak for itself, and I have no need for others to comment on me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "至于你想拿我的名字去刷话题，我的律师团队是非常专业的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for anyone trying to use my name to chase clout, my legal team is thoroughly professional.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "道可道，反过来读，你也能读得通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dao Ke Dao—read it backwards and it still makes complete sense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背，亲可成仇，敌可化友！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Heaven's way cycles round, yin and yang reverse, allies can turn foes, and enemies can become friends!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我觉得星天跟我的三观更合。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "并且星天有我非常信任的人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "早上我已经转发了，这件事情警方已经介入了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "大家在网上看到的那些不雅的照片，其实是合成的，嫌疑人也已经抓到。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这种对于成功的女性恶意的攻击和构陷，是非常无耻的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "在这里我顺便也向大家澄清一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "最近这两天一直有人在电视上吵架，并且频频提到了我的名字。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我向来都是用作品说话的，都用不着别人来评论我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "至于你想拿我的名字去刷话题，我的律师团队是非常专业的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "道可道，反过来读，你也能读得通。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天道循环，阴阳反背，亲可成仇，敌可化友！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watching from her desk, Bu Xiaogu realises why keeping a step back let her see Chun Yuqiao's whole strategy come together. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
